nded_subquestion_parts is present, concatenate its literal strings and\nthe exact strings named by {\"text_ref\": key} to recover grounded_subquestion.\nDecode these references before reasoning. They are storage references, not\nnew observations, citations, review permissions or evidence of agreement.\nReferences are input-only. Return full typed values in output observations\nunder the unchanged response schema; never return value_ref or text_ref.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"audit_verdict\":{\"enum\":[\"supported\",\"unknown\",\"conflict\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"final_prediction\":{\"enum\":[\"a\",\"b\",\"c\",\"d\",null],\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]},\"semantic_answer\":{},\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"minItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\",\"sema